# NON-RUNNABLE DOCUMENTATION ONLY. This file intentionally has no systemd unit
# sections and cannot be loaded as a unit. Root must create and review an actual
# unit later, behind a separately gated deployment artifact.

# Intended controls for that future review:
# - protected request and operator-control sockets kept separate;
# - a dedicated unprivileged service account and restrictive filesystem policy;
# - no repository-provided credentials, auto-approval, or provider endpoints;
# - explicit root approval before any unit is authored or installed.
